# Path budget: generated dependencies/caches at every depth; scratch is never delivered.
# dist/ is intentionally included. Source, lockfile, estimates and runtime assets are included.
**/node_modules/
**/.npm/
**/.vite/
**/.cache/
**/playwright-report/
**/test-results/
test/scratch/
*.tsbuildinfo
# Explicit delivery budget: required evidence <= 512 KiB; finding responses <= 32 KiB.
# These must be included even when the contributor's global excludes hide artifacts/dotfiles.
!/artifacts/
!/artifacts/**
!/.imd-responses.json
